"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhdefmFsMLOt7aNRmu6FFFhouMVzZqVnzg2YmUPP6CaS3dlQ78QtNhfdfBY7W5iEGo6gg7MEk-xZOFxqPhE6uUg_ExPzQXjmNmvDWClL_quZLhyHbcveYuM5kybgORhKVlzUmFe8VIWioaU75U7QRy7hbE0gF28IKNcekdj9CcFZITFKfAOzK4IFKgrAnTp=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg1W1zAuyy2DwqqPjJho8CJDnvZChzmf9CmtioySyrq0LctTQc41GvzSCOvwkrSJw6hV-Iv2O_p0PTduVM2ql8QHXU18AjCDzgs8rfvXjc37rHbikUQYyiM0HYiifPV7EsnUk8k_p1p8rG0D4x7iR1kq4t6LxbmewavdIcbp9BsEbjoEQw-OZq8PGCWGlLW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg1W1zAuyy2DwqqPjJho8CJDnvZChzmf9CmtioySyrq0LctTQc41GvzSCOvwkrSJw6hV-Iv2O_p0PTduVM2ql8QHXU18AjCDzgs8rfvXjc37rHbikUQYyiM0HYiifPV7EsnUk8k_p1p8rG0D4x7iR1kq4t6LxbmewavdIcbp9BsEbjoEQw-OZq8PGCWGlLW=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tse是阮tī鹽埕埔ê記憶，序大人m̄是hit款翁行某tuè ê角色。一个生性浪漫、有理想ê藥劑師，配一个愛安穩、重實際ê老師。Tī我ê印象--裡in ê感情無真鬥搭，不時為著無siāng款ê想法leh冤家量債。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮老爸40外冬lóng leh走tsông藥師公會ê代誌，in beh tī大港埔創業開藥房ê時，親tsiânn sì-kè lóng tshiàng衰講無偌久就ē倒擔。厝--裡hām藥房lóng是阿母一个查某人leh huānn，「做官騙厝內，做生理騙熟sāi」，啊阮老爸是tiānn hông騙俗進假藥。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">倔強ê阿母hām阮lóng bē親，萬事萬項lóng家己解決，教囝mā用真嚴格ê方式。我無法度kā伊sai-nai、無親密ê sio攬sio倚，m̄ bat看過伊流目屎，kan-na看伊受氣、怨tsheh。我ê心內總是有怨言——為啥mi̍h阿母lóng無像人講ê hit款溫柔？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我beh結婚、生囝ê時，為著代誌hām伊tsènn喙。有一擺受氣真大聲kā應：「你lóng無了解家己ê查某囝！」阿母隨應一句：「Án-ne你kám有了解--我？」Hit句話tsha̍k入我ê心肝內，對伊ê成見tsua̋nn hōo tín動--著。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">爸母hām小弟翁某蹛，後--來老爸tio̍h癌症倒tī眠床頂，已經84歲ê阿母猶原堅持beh家己照顧破病ê老伴。我kā tshiànn看護，一工就kâng罵走，連我mā罵參--落-去。老伴過身了後，阿母hām大兄翁某蹛做伙，無慣勢kah後生新婦蹛，lóng想beh搬--出-去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿母--à家己一个人sì-kè leh看新厝，hit箍圍仔ê建商lóng呵咾伊真khiàng。阿母--à看著一間見本厝，就招阮三个姊妹做伙看，阮lóng感覺bē-bái，伊隨提現金交定，隔--兩-工就扛兩跤大皮箱搬入新厝，連拍招呼to無。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Beh 90歲ê oo-bá-sáng，家己蹛、煮食、洗衫、款厝內。坐公車、捷運，mā ē教老人按怎行、按怎坐電梯。拄著外籍移工，ē làu英語「su-tián á-puh」（stand up）。攑雨傘行tī街路，沿路摃he無beh讓路ê oo-tóo-bái。拄著無禮貌ê學生，伊ē講：「Lín老師無教是--m̄？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄知「好歹在心內，喙脣皮sio款待」ê mê角，少年時我tiānn hām伊講--兩-句-仔就氣phut-phut，總是感覺阮bē ha̍h，慢慢tsiah體會著伊ê giám硬——是一種無聲ê疼thàng，一種m̄願輸ê溫柔，m̄是無情，是lóng藏tī心肝底無表現--出-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「手抱孩兒，tsiah知爸母時」是年歲khah有tsiah體會--著，阮母--à tī 96歲過身，伊ê形影iáu ē出現tī我ê夢中，kâm目屎醒--來tsiah知影，原來我leh思念--伊——giám硬ê阿母。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separato